{
  "name": "rain-wait-the-end",
  "comment": "The Rain-Wait, ending the-end: Bell points to Fen, the Rain-Wait tells the beginning of the lighthouse story, Fen finds the stranger's unsent letter, and the dreamer reads it aloud; the Rain-Wait goes home and leaves a dreamseed. Also checks the sealed-letter and give hints.",
  "clock": "2026-10-01T17:00:00+00:00",
  "players": [
    {
      "as": "A",
      "name": "Wren"
    }
  ],
